<h1>Invoice Reminder</h1>
<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>This is a reminder that your invoice (<b>#<%= @invoice.id %></b>) is due on <b><%= @invoice.deadline.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></b>.</p>
<p>Amount Due: <b>$<%= @invoice.amount %></b></p>
<p>Please ensure payment is made before the due date to avoid penalties.</p>
<p>Thank you.</p>
